t 21 I got drafted and became a  boy and that was a revelation to you  about about there are many different  kinds of abuse is that what you're  saying to us that's how to process that  yes we didn't have a physical abuse  problem but I can say there were  different forms of abuse that take that  took place was it  no financial you get to the physical and  that's obviously like if it's one time  is still one time too many I'm curious  janae did you think that you were in  abusive relationship knowing what he  just said that there are many different  forms of abuse no no I just thought we  were being a typical you know boyfriend  and girlfriend like we argue and argue  and I didn't really sit back and think  about it until I was forced to think  about it janay rice has never seen the  video from inside the elevator the one  where ray punches her I think it's so  hard for people to understand right why  you haven't looked at that tape I was  there yeah I lived it I don't really  need to relive it over and over again  just to appease the world you've also  said that was the first and only time  yes because you know why you have to  reassure people and the doubting  Thomases and I would almost put myself  in that group because it justifies every  statistic in the world about what  happens in an abusive situation right a  that that's the first time and oh by the  way just happened to be caught on tape  it had never happened before and be four  years later that has never happened  right the all the naysayers the people  who doubt our genuineness they could  spend an hour with us and they will walk  away and say okay yeah what do you think  Ray when you look at it now I hate that  person I hate him somewhere down the  line everybody was saying does he  deserve a second chance for football and  distance I know that I actually got my  second chance  how sit right here with your wife  they're my darkest moments and I sacks  myself how can she even want to support  me like but